Here's a step-by-step guide to create a basic Snake game using C and SDL:

### Step 1: Install SDL
First, you need to install SDL on your system. You can find installation instructions for various operating systems on the official SDL website: https://www.libsdl.org/download-2.0.php

For example, on Ubuntu, you can install SDL using:
```sh
sudo apt-get update
